			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "按日期建立和引用"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20261008101708-idqliwj",
			"Type": "NodeParagraph",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20261008101708-idqliwj",
				"updated": "20261008101708"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "在編輯器中輸入 "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "code",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "[[今天"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "、"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "code",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "[[明天"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "、"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "code",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "[[9月25日"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": " 或 "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "code",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "[[25 sept"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "，可在區塊引用補全中顯示對應日期的日記候選。支援目前介面語言和英文的相對日期、月份全稱及縮寫，也支援 "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "code",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "[[2026-09-25"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": " 這樣的完整公曆日期。"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20261008101708-wyphboq",
			"Type": "NodeParagraph",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20261008101708-wyphboq",
				"updated": "20261008101708"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "未填寫年份時使用目前年份，候選項會顯示完整日期。對於 "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "code",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "03/04"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": " 等有歧義的表達或無效日期，請改用 "
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeTextMark",
					"TextMarkType": "code",
					"TextMarkTextContent": "YYYY-MM-DD"
				},
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": " 格式。一般文件搜尋仍可使用。"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20261008101708-e6z4q69",
			"Type": "NodeParagraph",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20261008101708-e6z4q69",
				"updated": "20261008101708"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "選取日記候選後，使用上次選取的日記筆記本；尚未選取或原筆記本無法使用時，會提示選取。取消選取不會建立文件。加密筆記本內只能引用本筆記本的日記，一般筆記本不能引用加密筆記本的日記。"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"ID": "20261008101708-j20nycr",
			"Type": "NodeParagraph",
			"Properties": {
				"id": "20261008101708-j20nycr",
				"updated": "20261008101708"
			},
			"Children": [
				{
					"Type": "NodeText",
					"Data": "輸入和查看候選不會建立文件。選取後會沿用目標筆記本中對應日期的日記，包括已移動或重新命名但保留日記日期屬性的文件；不存在時才依日記設定建立並插入區塊引用。路徑範本、內容範本中的 now 和日記日期屬性使用目標日期，實際建立和更新時間保持真實操作時間。"
				}
			]
		},
